copy:
  title: Where may Kernle send memory excerpts?
  body:
  - Kernle sends short excerpts of episodes to this provider during background consolidation, and nothing
    else. Choose None to keep everything on this machine.
  actions:
  - Anthropic API key
  - OpenAI-compatible endpoint
  - Claude Code headless
  - Codex headless
  - Host agent
  - None
